<view class="page profile-page"><view class="page-title">慢慢认识你。</view><view class="subtitle">喜欢动物，就是我们共同的开场白。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取资料…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="btn btn-secondary" bindtap="refresh">重新加载</button></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{mode === 'demo'}}" class="demo-label">本机演示 · 资料只保存在当前设备</view><view class="profile-form card"><view class="avatar-intro row"><image class="profile-avatar" src="{{avatar}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><view class="intro-title">先从简单的介绍开始</view><view class="small muted">昵称和默认头像随公开内容展示</view></view></view><view class="field"><view class="label">昵称 <text class="required">必填</text></view><input class="input" value="{{nickname}}" data-field="nickname" bindinput="input" maxlength="20" placeholder="大家可以怎么称呼你" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">私人生活片区 <text class="optional">选填</text></view><picker range="{{areas}}" value="{{areaIndex}}" bindchange="selectArea" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="input picker-value row between"><text>{{areas[areaIndex]}}</text><text class="muted">⌄</text></view></picker><view class="field-hint">此片区仅自己可见，不会自动带入下方的公开活动片区。</view></view><view class="field"><view class="label">一句自我介绍 <text class="optional">选填 · 由下方公开范围决定</text></view><textarea class="textarea bio-input" value="{{bio}}" data-field="bio" bindinput="input" maxlength="150" placeholder="记录喜欢的动物、日常爱好，或者此刻想记下的小事…" disabled="{{busy}}"/><view class="word-count">{{bio.length}} / 150</view></view></view><view class="pet-form card">
  <view class="row between"><view class="section-title">我的动物伙伴</view><button class="pet-add" bindtap="editPet" disabled="{{busy}}">＋ 添加</button></view>
  <view class="pet-caption">选填，可登记最多 8 只。没有养宠，也一样欢迎。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!pets.length}}" class="pet-empty">记下名字、品种、生日或大致年龄，为每个小伙伴留一张照片。</view>
  <view wx:for="{{pets}}" wx:key="id" class="pet-record">
    <view class="row pet-record-head"><image wx:if="{{item.photo}}" class="pet-photo" src="{{item.photo}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="pet-photo pet-photo-empty">🐾</view><view class="pet-record-copy"><view class="pet-record-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="pet-record-meta">{{item.typeName}}{{item.breed ? ' · ' + item.breed : ''}}{{item.ageLabel ? ' · ' + item.ageLabel : ''}}</view><view wx:if="{{index === 0}}" class="pet-primary-note">头像旁与附近名片优先展示</view></view></view>
    <view class="pet-record-actions"><button bindtap="editPet" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">编辑资料</button><button bindtap="petPhotoAction" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="select" disabled="{{busy || item.pendingPhoto}}">{{item.photo ? '更换照片' : '添加照片'}}</button><button wx:if="{{item.photo}}" bindtap="petPhotoAction" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="remove" disabled="{{busy}}">移除照片</button><button class="pet-remove" bindtap="deletePet" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">移除宠物</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.pendingPhoto}}" class="pet-photo-status"><view>{{item.pendingPhoto.message}}</view><view class="pet-record-actions"><button wx:if="{{item.pendingPhoto.retryable}}" bindtap="petPhotoAction" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="retry" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.pendingPhoto.status === 'pending' ? '检查审核结果' : '重试照片'}}</button><button bindtap="petPhotoAction" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="discard" disabled="{{busy}}">移除本次选择</button></view></view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{petPhotoError}}" class="field-hint">{{petPhotoError}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{petEditorOpen}}" class="pet-editor">
    <view class="section-title">{{editingPetId ? '编辑宠物资料' : '添加动物伙伴'}}</view>
    <view class="field"><view class="label">名字 <text class="required">必填</text></view><input class="input" value="{{petDraftName}}" data-field="petDraftName" bindinput="input" maxlength="24" placeholder="它叫什么名字" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view>
    <view class="field"><view class="label">动物种类</view><picker range="{{petTypes}}" range-key="name" value="{{petDraftTypeIndex}}" bindchange="selectPetType" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="input picker-value row between"><text>{{petTypes[petDraftTypeIndex].name}}</text><text>⌄</text></view></picker></view>
    <view class="field"><view class="label">品种 <text class="optional">选填</text></view><input class="input" value="{{petDraftBreed}}" data-field="petDraftBreed" bindinput="input" maxlength="40" placeholder="如中华田园猫，也可以暂不填写" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view>
    <view class="field"><view class="label">生日或大致年龄</view><view class="privacy-options"><view class="privacy-option {{petAgeMode === 'unknown' ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectPetAgeMode" data-value="unknown">暂不填写</view><view class="privacy-option {{petAgeMode === 'birthday' ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectPetAgeMode" data-value="birthday">记得生日</view><view class="privacy-option {{petAgeMode === 'age' ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="selectPetAgeMode" data-value="age">大致年龄</view></view></view>
    <picker wx:if="{{petAgeMode === 'birthday'}}" mode="date" value="{{petBirthDate}}" start="1900-01-01" end="{{today}}" bindchange="selectPetBirthday" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="input picker-value">{{petBirthDate || '选择生日'}} ⌄</view></picker>
    <view wx:if="{{petAgeMode === 'age'}}" class="pet-age-inputs"><input class="input" type="number" value="{{petAgeYears}}" data-field="petAgeYears" bindinput="input" maxlength="3" placeholder="0" disabled="{{busy}}"/><text>岁</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{petAgeMonths}}" data-field="petAgeMonths" bindinput="input" maxlength="2" placeholder="0" disabled="{{busy}}"/><text>个月</text></view>
    <view class="field-hint">生日仅自己可见；公开主页展示换算后的年龄。先保存资料，再为它选择照片。</view>
    <view class="pet-editor-actions"><button class="btn btn-secondary" bindtap="closePetEditor" disabled="{{busy}}">取消</button><button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="savePet" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存宠物</button></view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{hasPet}}" class="pet-display-setting"><view class="label">在头像旁展示第一只宠物</view><view class="pet-display-description">仅展示名字与种类。完整宠物资料和照片由下方主页公开范围控制。</view><view class="privacy-options"><view class="privacy-option {{showPet ? '' : 'active'}}" bindtap="petDisplayState" data-value="no">不展示</view><view class="privacy-option {{showPet ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="petDisplayState" data-value="yes">展示名字与种类</view></view></view>
</view><view class="privacy-form card"><view class="section-title">主页介绍的公开范围</view><view class="privacy-description">此开关控制主页中的简介与宠物详情，头像旁的宠物展示由上方独立设置。「私人生活片区」始终不公开；加入附近宠友时，可在下方另选「公开活动片区」。</view><view class="privacy-options"><view class="privacy-option {{publicProfile ? '' : 'active'}}" bindtap="privacyState" data-value="private">仅自己可见</view><view class="privacy-option {{publicProfile ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="privacyState" data-value="public">公开到我的主页</view></view><view class="privacy-current">{{publicProfile ? '保存后，其他用户可以在你的主页看到简介及已填写的宠物资料。' : showPet ? '简介保持私密；宠物名字和类型按头像旁展示设置公开。' : '简介与宠物仅自己可见，其他人仍可查看公开分享与关注数量。'}}</view></view>
<view class="neighbor-form card">
  <view class="section-title">加入附近宠友</view>
  <view class="privacy-description">独立选择是否展示名片。活动片区会公开；上方的私人生活片区不会自动带入。保存后生效。</view>
  <view class="privacy-options"><view class="privacy-option {{neighborVisible ? '' : 'active'}}" bindtap="neighborState" data-value="no">暂不加入</view><view class="privacy-option {{neighborVisible ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="neighborState" data-value="yes">展示我的名片</view></view>
  <block wx:if="{{neighborVisible}}">
    <view class="field"><view class="label">公开活动片区</view><picker range="{{neighborAreaChoices}}" range-key="label" value="{{neighborAreaIndex}}" bindchange="selectNeighborArea" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="input picker-value row between"><text>{{neighborAreaChoices[neighborAreaIndex].label}}</text><text class="muted">⌄</text></view></picker></view>
    <view class="field-hint">完成手机号核验后可加入。已公开的宠物会出现在「宠物邻居」；未展示宠物资料时，出现在「爱宠同好」。宠物与简介继续遵循上方公开设置。</view>
    <view class="residence-setting">
      <view class="label">展示居住地大致距离 <text class="optional">独立选填</text></view>
      <view class="privacy-description">双方都开启才显示约距范围。手选位置在本机转换为约 1 km 网格，仅保存粗网格，不保存门牌、地址或原始坐标，不提供到人导航。</view>
      <view class="privacy-options"><view class="privacy-option {{residenceSharing ? '' : 'active'}}" bindtap="residenceState" data-value="no">不展示</view><view class="privacy-option {{residenceSharing ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="residenceState" data-value="yes">展示大致距离</view></view>
      <block wx:if="{{residenceSharing}}"><view class="residence-status">{{residenceCell ? '已选好居住范围 · 保存后生效' : '尚未选择居住范围'}}</view><button class="btn btn-secondary residence-picker" bindtap="chooseResidence" disabled="{{busy}}">{{residenceCell ? '重新选择居住位置' : '手选居住位置'}}</button><view class="field-hint">居住位置每 24 小时可更新一次。关闭展示后保存，会清除已存的居住网格；退出附近宠友也会清除。</view></block>
    </view>
  </block>
  <view wx:else class="field-hint">保存后退出附近宠友，并关闭居住距离、清除居住网格。公开日常仍可正常浏览。</view>
</view>
<button class="btn btn-primary save-button" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存我的介绍</button></block></view>
